{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611470/extras/farm_chase.gif?t=1745202661\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A CURSED PLACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Abandoned and surrounded by disturbing stories, <strong>Lorich\u00b4s Farm</strong> was home to a happy family, who succumbed to madness for obscure reasons, and ended up committing terrible acts, even against themselves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAMEPLAY <strong>[DEMO]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play one of the four stages of the full game, The Lorich\u00b4s Farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect all the <strong>keys</strong> around the level to escape, while doing everything you can to keep your distance from an unstoppable, macabre Scarecrow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the tension of a <strong>frenetic chase</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid getting caught in <strong>traps</strong> and keep your distance from the creature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect <strong>batteries</strong> throughout the stage to keep your flashlight on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect the &quot;<strong>Sneakers</strong>&quot; around the stage to keep running</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3611470?t=1745202661","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611470/d599c9815a99ac22fbc448560d5aec881e6e49fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745202661","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611470/bb1949fd927d3abe9f9d483f27ee8dcfe0e3d0c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745202661","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3611470/bb1949fd927d3abe9f9d483f27ee8dcfe0e3d0c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745202661","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","i